  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero__text">
        <h1>Network security, from the firewall down to the packet.</h1>
        <p>I’m Ahmed Ehab Abdalmeged, an Information Systems student at New Cairo University (class of 2028). I build and test secure networks, and I’m learning to find weaknesses before attackers do.</p>
        <div class="hero__actions">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
          <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/magribi1/Ahmed-Ehap-Abd-Elmged">GitHub</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <pre class="scan" aria-label="Summary of skills shown as a network scan"><span class="scan__cmd">$ nmap -sV ahmed.local</span>
PORT     STATE  SERVICE
22/tcp   open   networking
         <span class="scan__dim">TCP/IP, VLANs, OSPF, Subnetting</span>
443/tcp  open   firewalls
         <span class="scan__dim">Huawei USG, ACLs, VPN, IPS</span>
80/tcp   open   web-security
         <span class="scan__dim">OWASP Top 10, Burp Suite</span>
8080/tcp open   recon
         <span class="scan__dim">Nmap, Nessus, Wireshark</span>
<span class="scan__dim">Scan done: 4 services up</span></pre>
    </section>

    <section id="skills" class="row">
      <h2>Skills</h2>
      <div id="skills-list" class="skills"></div>
    </section>

    <section id="certifications" class="row">
      <h2>Certifications</h2>
      <ul class="items">
        <li>
          <h3>HCIA-Security</h3>
          <p>Earned through NTI. Covers network security concepts, common threats and prevention, firewall security policies, NAT, hot standby and intrusion prevention, encryption fundamentals, PKI, and IPSec/SSL VPN.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>CCNA</h3>
          <p>Completed online. Covers switching, VLANs, inter-VLAN routing, static and dynamic routing, and troubleshooting.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="training" class="row">
      <h2>Training</h2>
      <ul class="items">
        <li>
          <h3>Network Security Internship, NTI</h3>
          <p>One-month training focused on network security.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Hands-on labs</h3>
          <p>Switching, VLANs, static and dynamic routing, OSPF, and Huawei firewall configuration, built in Cisco Packet Tracer and Huawei eNSP.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

